OL,3,GNEWSARambo the 100kg ram rescued after
OL,4,Agetting stuck in pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have rescued a 100kg ram
OL,7,Fnamed Rambo after he became "firmly
OL,8,Fwedged" inside a concrete pipe.
OL,10,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService said a crew from Somerton were
OL,12,Falerted to the stranded sheep on Sunday
OL,13,F- ensuring the fire station's 200th
OL,14,Fcallout of the year would be a
OL,15,Fmemorable one.
OL,17,FThe fire service said the crew managed
OL,18,Fto slide Rambo out using "a number of
OL,19,Fdifferent pieces of equipment",
OL,20,Fincluding a chimney rod, rope and a
OL,21,Fsheet placed underneath him.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
