OL,3,GNEWSARambo the 100kg ram rescued after
OL,4,Agetting stuck in pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis owner Bex Maynard, from Western
OL,7,FFarm in Kingsdon, Somerset, said Rambo
OL,8,Femerged from the tunnel
OL,9,F"unceremoniously" but "completely
OL,10,Funharmed".
